  {"text": "Flat in spring, climbing all summer: one year of sales at a made-up coffee shop."},
  {"text": "The costs are beans, rent, and staff. Beans take the biggest share."},
  {"text": "Take what comes in, subtract what goes out, and what is left is profit."},
  {"text": "Split that profit in two: coffee earns most of it, pastries only a little."}
